    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this beautiful 4 bedroom semi detached property to the market for sale. \n\nThis property comes to the market in good clean and tidy condition and has also been well maintained by its current owners. This property comprises of the bright and airy entrance hallway leading to the kitchen/dining, utility room, sunroom, living room and guest wc all downstairs. Upstairs is the family bathroom and four large bedrooms, one of which is ensuite. There is ample parking to the front of the property. The landscaped rear garden features a durable, weather-toned concrete paved patio seamlessly framed by established, mature planted borders offering a low maintenance yet green outdoor sanctuary ideal for relaxing or entertaining. \n\nMoorefield Park is a mature estate and a well sought after area. The property is located within walking distance to all local amenities including primary and secondary schools, shops, bars, restaurants, Banks, Post Office, leading \nsupermarket chains, Whitewater Shopping Centre and much more. The town has a regular bus service and train station. Access to the M7/N7 motorway is only a stones throw away making it an ideal choice for any commuter. \n\nViewing is highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, downstairs storage, alarm point \n\nKitchen/Dining: Wooden flooring, fully fitted kitchen, ceramic sink, oven, hob, extractor fan, access to sunroom, utility room and sliding door to living room \n\nUtility Room: Wooden flooring, worktop, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, back door leading to garden area\n\nSunroom: Wooden flooring, doorway access to large rear garden \n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, coving, centre rose, blinds, feature fireplace with wrought iron insert and polished hearth, double doors leading to dining area \n\nGuest WC/Storage: Wooden flooring, spot lights, WHB, WC \n\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring, fitted wardrobe \n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, fitted wardrobe \n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring, fitted wardrobe \n\nBedroom 4: Wooden flooring, fitted wardrobe \n\nFamily Bathroom: Tiled floor to ceiling, bath, WHB, WC \n\nFeatures:\n\nFully alarmed\nSelected carpets, curtains, blinds and light fittings included\nComposite hall door\nPVC double glazed windows\nNot overlooked\nOutside tap\nPatio area to rear\nTarmac drive\nMains water\nMains sewage\nNatural gas heating system\nBuilt in 1976\nc.126.91sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
